hey guys it's Tuesday October 27th I'm  Mary Kish and this is GameSpot news we  have all the good announcements from  sony's press conference mixed with a  little bit of fallout 4 news let's get  started first up there was a fallout 4  leak that showed the Xbox one control  scheme including new abilities with  under two weeks to go before fallout 4s  release the RPGs manual has repeatedly  been uploaded to the Xbox SmartGlass app  revealing the game's default control  scheme new abilities and more as  detailed through these images fallout 4  Xbox one controls include new options  for bash attack and sprint among other  things grenades are now thrown by  holding RB while pressing lb will bring  up the vast shooting screen check out  the article on gamespot to see all the  different default controls next up the  creator of Raymond showed up at Paris  games week to showcase a new gameplay  demo of ps4 exclusive wild Rayman  creator Michelle on cell took the stage  of Sony's Paris games week press  conference to present a gameplay  demonstration of his upcoming ps4 open  world survival game called wild gameplay  seems to revolve around controlling a  magical shaman who can use his powers to  take controls of various animals like an  eagle a rabbit or even a raven he can  also tame animals for his own use like  being able to write a bear for faster  travel through the lush green landscape  seen in this demo first announced at  Gamescom 2014 not too many details have  been revealed about wild until now  finally Paris games week revealed an  image for street fighter 5 teasing six  new characters today during Sony's Paris  games week briefing street fighter 5  producer Yoshinori Ono announced that at  least six new DLC characters are coming  to the fighting game beginning in 2016  he didn't reveal their names instead  capcom released this mysterious  silhouette image you see these six  characters whoever they are will be  unlockable either through gameplay  or via micro transactions in fact all  street fighter 5 gameplay DLC will be  free providing you're willing to play  enough there's no confirmation but we're  guessing the first one might be Alex the  middle could be possibly jury or ibuki  and the far-right possibly deadly or  Balrog who do you think the mystery  characters are let me know in the  comments below capcom also announced  today that Street Fighter 5 will launch  in February 2016 across ps4 and PC in  addition the character dhalsim has  joined the roster so that's all the news  I have for you today you can go back to  playing halo now unless you haven't  bought it yet in which you can check out  Mike McCarty's review it's on gamespot  now see you tomorrow
 

